        <mxCell id="step3" value="3. Tenant Security&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;if (payload.tenant != apikey.tenant):&lt;br&gt;  return 403 Forbidden&lt;br&gt;  log_security_violation()&lt;br&gt;  send_to_dlq()&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#FFEBEE;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
